# Business Report on Sports Operations: Teams, Leagues, Venues, Broadcasting, and Sponsorships

## Executive Summary

This report provides an in-depth analysis of the current state of sports operations within the United States, focusing on teams, leagues, venues, broadcasting, and sponsorships. Notably, it examines the relationships between these entities and their contributions to the overall sports ecosystem. The findings will be beneficial for stakeholders, including team owners, league executives, venue managers, broadcasters, and sponsors, providing insights into current trends, operational challenges, and opportunities for growth.

